Spec: Pinned backend source overlays

Purpose:
  Supply small reviewable additions to the derived pinned FRP source.

Structure:
  ./cmd: Explicit server lifecycle commands and separate isolated native-runtime fixtures.
  ./client: Private owned-Agent connectors without exported device keys.
  ./server: Authenticated backend entry points and actual server path checks.
  ./internal: In-process public-certificate and authority fixtures used only by tests.
  ./pkg: Hole-punch session authorization binding and shared test fixtures.

Must:
  Keep production overlays independent of test fixture secrets and leave all upstream modifications represented by the owned patch.
